    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"7200\" class=\"elementor elementor-7200\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-21afbfb6 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"6862\" data-id=\"21afbfb6\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3101caea\" data-eae-slider=\"47580\" data-id=\"3101caea\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b77165 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3b77165\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Founder, Marie Drake, on Community Chats with Kaitlin Nares</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4471904 elementor-widget elementor-widget-video\" data-id=\"4471904\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;youtube_url&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DEDtGyB99OY&quot;,&quot;video_type&quot;:&quot;youtube&quot;,&quot;controls&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"video.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-wrapper elementor-open-inline\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-video\"></div>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62505314 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"62505314\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>This week on Community Chats</h2><p>Golden, CO Divorce and Family Law attorney Marie Drake sat down with<a href=\"https://www.hntriallaw.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Kaitlin Nares on her Community Chats show</a>. Kaitlin is part of Hagen Nares PLLC Truck Wreck &amp; Brain Injury Lawyers.</p><p>They spoke about what it&#8217;s like running a law firm, what the journey has been, and how to ensure clients are provided with stellar service.</p><p>If you&#8217;re looking for <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/family-law/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">family law services including divorce, common-law marriage, property division, spousal support, child custody and support, adoption, and marital agreements</a>, give our team a call.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t"
  },
